Idea: Incentive messaging

Given 

{noformat}Pull Requests containing 120 or fewer lines of change have a median open time of
6 hours, 33 minutes, and 09 seconds. On the other hand, Pull Requests with more than 120 lines of
change have a median open time of 23 hours, 55 minutes, and 45 seconds.{noformat}

from [https://taxify.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/ENGINEERING/pages/4768301303/Pull+Request+Size#Problem|https://taxify.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/ENGINEERING/pages/4768301303/Pull+Request+Size#Problem|smart-link] 

The message should incentivize the author to make smaller PRs. I’d recommend that the warning be written in an approachable way, something like:

 {{Did you know that a PR with less than 120 changes gets merged on average 18 hours faster than its bigger counterparts?}}

And for the correction message, scenario C, it should be something like {{Great! Your PR is under 120 changes which means it has a great chance to be merged in the next 6 hours.}}

