TiDB clusters are collected from {{ti-manager}} API:

{{http://ti-manager.sqldb/tiup/json/list.json}}



Then clusters are iterated to get data from all {{tidb}} nodes in the cluster:

{{http://ti-manager.sqldb/tiup/json/<cluster>.json}}



The API refresh the data every 10 minutes. If a shorter period is required, a new cron must be setup but for now 10 minutes is OK

{noformat}root@ti-manager:/etc# cat /etc/cron.d/tiup-web 
PATH=/usr/bin:/usr/local/bin:/root/.tiup/bin/

*/10 * * * * root m collect /var/www/html/tiup/json{noformat}

MySQL clusters are collected from {{orchestrator}} API:

{{http://orchestrator.sqldb/api/clusters}}

 

Then clusters are iterated to get data from the {{primary}} and the direct {{replicas}} in the cluster:

{{http://orchestrator.sqldb/api/instance/<primary>/3306}}

{{http://orchestrator.sqldb/api/instance/<replica>/3306}}

