* 2 reminders are to be sent to the driver during the following 2 days in case no response is provided within 24h of the first sent message;
* The last reminder (of the 2) to the driver should specify that the matter will be closed within 24h with no charged fee to the customer if no response is provided by the driver;
* After 24h pass since the last reminder is sent and there is still no reply from the driver, the price review can be closed.

